### AI tools and admin endpoints. Sign in as admin@ticketiq.local / the seeded initial password first.
@base = http://localhost:8080

###
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "admin@ticketiq.local", "password": "12345678", "role": "ADMIN" }

###
@token = PASTE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Dry run: the whole AI pipeline on text you supply, nothing saved
POST {{base}}/api/ai/dry-run/triage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Double payment", "description": "I was charged twice. Card 4111 1111 1111 1111." }

### AI health, metrics and audit log (admin)
GET {{base}}/api/ai/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Switch the AI off (tickets keep working) and back on
PUT {{base}}/api/ai/switch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enabled": false }

### Knowledge base
GET {{base}}/api/kb
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/api/kb
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Changing your display language", "content": "Open Profile, then Preferences, and choose a language. The change applies at once.", "tags": "howto" }

### Create a user
POST {{base}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "new.agent", "employeeId": "123456", "password": "Str0ngPassw0rd!", "fullName": "New Agent", "role": "AGENT" }

### Public info and health (no token)
GET {{base}}/api/meta

###
GET {{base}}/actuator/health

### Public signup creates a USER profile (then sign in with the chosen user ID)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "employeeId": "11223344", "fullName": "New User", "userId": "new.user.demo", "password": "SecureDemo9!" }
